@startuml
title SD-F03 — Fee consent, checkout and handoff
caption To-Be draft | PRD-07–09 / SA-F03 · Order / Fulfilment
actor Customer as C
actor Merchant as M
boundary API
database PostgreSQL as DB
C -> API : Submit terms, cart version and idempotency key
API -> DB : TX-04 snapshot or replay original result
alt Merchant delivery
 M -> API : Record serviceability, fee and handoff revision
 C -> API : Consent to fee revision
 API -> DB : Check version, final terms and capacity
else Pickup or customer-arranged delivery
 API -> DB : Enter Cash acceptance or direct transfer path
end
M -> API : Record preparation, readiness and handoff
alt Handoff fails
 API -> DB : Record incident and agreed disposition
 opt Reschedule with consent
  API -> DB : Swap unused capacity or reserve a new remake generation
 end
else Handoff succeeds
 API -> DB : Guard transition and record timestamps
end
@enduml
